{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"tool_rxxeWtEkKH2h6GiiTnXhflmK","content":"1\t{\n2\t  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\n3\t  \"title\": \"verdict-artifact\",\n4\t  \"description\": \"autonomous-mode.md 机件 #3 的验收工件 schema。verify 每轮必产 docs/test-reports/{BL-id}-verdict.json，喂沉淀引擎（§8.4）。存在≠真实：每 feature 的 evidence / steps_to_reproduce 必须非空，机械拒收空壳 PASS。v1.1 起兼作 dispatch-mode.md 的跨厂商交付契约（deliverable.schema），并承载 waiting 中断态。\",\n5\t  \"type\": \"object\",\n6\t  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n7\t  \"required\": [\"batch_id\", \"fix_round\", \"created_at\", \"verdicts\"],\n8\t  \"properties\": {\n9\t    \"batch_id\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"= progress.json.current_sprint（BL-id）\" },\n10\t    \"fix_round\": { \"type\": \"integer\", \"minimum\": 0 },\n11\t    \"created_at\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"format\": \"date-time\" },\n12\t    \"waiting\": {\n13\t      \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"],\n14\t      \"enum\": [\"auth\", \"adjudication\", null],\n15\t      \"default\": null,\n16\t      \"description\": \"dispatch-mode.md 的中断态降维表达（借 A2A AUTH_REQUIRED / INPUT_REQUIRED 语义）。一次性 CLI 进程无法「挂起等你」，故把中断态编码进产物：撞 L2 边界而未获授权 → 'auth'；规格歧义 / acceptance 无法客观判定 → 'adjudication'。写完照常 exit 0——不要用非零退出码表达「我需要人」，那会被回执推断判成 FAILED 并触发无意义重派。编排者读到非空即硬停交人类。\"\n17\t    },\n18\t    \"waiting_detail\": {\n19\t      \"type\": \"string\",\n20\t      \"minLength\": 1,\n21\t      \"description\": \"waiting 非空时必填：卡在哪条 feature、需要什么授权或裁决。人类据此一眼判断如何解锁\"\n22\t    },\n23\t    \"verdicts\": {\n24\t      \"type\": \"array\",\n25\t      \"items\": {\n26\t        \"type\": \"object\",\n27\t        \"additionalProperties\": false,\n28\t        \"required\": [\"feature_id\", \"result\", \"evidence\", \"steps_to_reproduce\"],\n29\t        \"properties\": {\n30\t          \"feature_id\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n31\t          \"result\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"PASS\", \"PARTIAL\", \"FAIL\"] },\n32\t          \"evidence\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1, \"description\": \"实测证据（测试输出/命令/staging 结果），非空——空 = 空壳，拒收\" },\n33\t          \"steps_to_reproduce\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"minLength\": 1 }\n34\t        }\n35\t      }\n36\t    }\n37\t  },\n38\t  \"if\": {\n39\t    \"properties\": { \"waiting\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"auth\", \"adjudication\"] } },\n40\t    \"required\": [\"waiting\"]\n41\t  },\n42\t  \"then\": {\n43\t    \"_comment\": \"中断态下允许 verdicts 为空或部分——被授权/裁决卡住时本就验不完，强行要求满额会逼出编造的证据\",\n44\t    \"required\": [\"waiting_detail\"],\n45\t    \"properties\": { \"verdicts\": { \"minItems\": 0 } }\n46\t  },\n47\t  \"else\": {\n48\t    \"_comment\": \"非中断态：verdicts 必须非空，否则这轮验收没有产出，沉淀引擎无燃料\",\n49\t    \"properties\": { \"verdicts\": { \"minItems\": 1 } }\n50\t  }\n51\t}"}
{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"tool_NUO1qMialx9KWnmJZjMs4Do1","content":"1\t# BL-RELEASE-READINESS: exact candidate and safe operator preflight\n2\t\n3\t## Goal and authorization\n4\t\n5\tThe user transferred coordination and explicitly authorized the Coordinator to\n6\tpush main and deploy only after release gates pass. This overrides the external\n7\tCodex no-push restriction for that authorized coordination; dispatched workers\n8\tmust never push. Non-main CI publication, maintenance timing and encrypted\n9\toff-host backup remain unanswered at planning. A subsequent user reply authorized\n10\tnon-main CI publication and maintenance now; encrypted backup target remains\n11\tunanswered. Never write pending_gate.decision.\n12\t\n13\tThis batch prepares the accepted candidate for release. It does NOT perform a\n14\tlegacy baseline switch, mutate production, rotate passwords, create an Agent\n15\trelease or close original BL-HOMEPAGE-FRESHNESS F005. B08 CAS, mutable OpenCode\n16\tcursor and new capabilities remain separate. Do not call this the full upgrade.\n17\t\n18\t## Frozen inputs\n19\t\n20\t- Candidate baseline: f700b9ae94c0663a6b7a6fb59acec244ea2b8659.\n21\t- Accepted queue implementation: 27d9664e37a659ad28962bee224d871378e4336c.\n22\t- Accepted process bounds candidate: 3130cef3bc55528290c49ee35267e1aff33b5c78.\n23\t- Other integration: d8b4d7d6d5d5ed84165ea938a83b72d602cad9ab.\n24\t- B04 source commits: d0cc44e, 6360404, 13f6ae6, 3d0a974.\n25\t- B05 proposed guard: bc9badc8c9c62aaaa2b4aa92ab40d7bc37ee9ed6.\n26\t\n27\tPrior state archived unchanged in docs/archive/process-bounds-closeout-20261008/.\n28\tFreeze historical reports/tests/assertions/fixtures, dependencies/overrides/vendor,\n29\tschema/migrations. Do not merge the older integration wholesale: it lacks the\n30\taccepted queue/process changes. Candidate is a broad existing upgrade composition;\n31\trecord true scope, not a two-file hotfix. Root main's active batch remains untouched.\n32\t\n33\tAt 2026-10-08T04:24Z remote main was 2074991; public health reported 92d410c;\n34\tPOSTGRES_PASSWORD Secret was absent and production protection_rules was empty.\n35\tDefault SSH to the documented VPS was denied. These are blockers, not permission\n36\tto search personal credentials. User inputs and live evidence override snapshots.\n37\t\n38\t## F001 - Compose macOS native gate without replacing accepted slices\n39\t\n40\tTransport B04 macOS launchd code, portable fixture/trap tests and bounded service\n41\tcleanup from the listed commits. Keep B06/B07 PG16 env/probes/no-skip floor, all\n42\taccepted process/queue bytes and every other release prerequisite. Add macOS to\n43\trelease-artifact/deploy needs. Resolve conflicts explicitly, record source SHA/path\n44\thashes; run focused tests/typecheck. No signed/notarized distribution or actual user\n45\tservice installation claim.\n46\t\n47\t## F002 - Fail closed before deployment mutations\n48\t\n49\tTransport bc9badc's live/retained predecessor guard and regression controls. Before\n50\trsync, .env replacement or candidate manifest creation require one serving app,\n51\texact Compose project/service, 127.0.0.1:3010 binding, activated old digest/config/\n52\tSHA ledger and backend readiness. Reject absent/legacy/mismatched predecessors and\n53\tstale retry records. Never fabricate activation records. Preserve old assertions;\n54\tadd separate negative controls if imported tests conflict. This is not bootstrap\n55\tor a general concurrent-deployment lock; report those limits.\n56\t\n57\t## F003 - Read-only host inventory via existing Actions SSH identity\n58\t\n59\tAdd workflow_dispatch input operation: release (default) or host-preflight.\n60\tHost-preflight executes ONLY a non-deploying inventory job using existing VPS\n61\tconnection Secrets. No builds, rsync/scp, registry login/pull, backups/migrations,\n62\tconfiguration writes or service changes. Normal release jobs run on push/PR or\n63\tdispatch release; host-preflight can never enter deploy, including on main.\n64\t\n65\tSend reviewed scripts/ci/vps-host-preflight.sh over SSH stdin. Validate configured\n66\tdeployment path/host/user/port before interpolation. Fixed project scope only;\n67\tno source .env. Query allowlisted Docker/Compose versions, platform/free-space,\n68\ttokenizer app/postgres IDs/status/project/network/volume, image revision/UID,\n69\tselected GIT_COMMIT/APP_IMAGE/MIGRATE_IMAGE/APP_HOST_PORT nonsecret fields,\n70\tbackend readiness and existing config/ledger hashes/modes. No raw .env,\n71\tConfig.Env, DB rows, session data, credentials or personal paths. Explicit\n72\tunknown/legacy markers; absent/unhealthy/wrong serving app fails closed.\n73\t\n74\tBound remote queries; no signals to user services. Upload allowlisted redacted\n75\tinventory only, including source SHA and timestamp. Failed stderr must not expose\n76\tsecrets. Add synthetic fixtures for legacy/digest positives, missing/wrong app,\n77\tduplicate settings, malicious arguments/env canaries, timeouts, no mutation\n78\tinvocations, no raw secret/config output, operation separation and preserved\n79\tnormal gates. This only inventories; it must not establish a baseline ledger.\n80\t\n81\t## F004 - Local regressions and exact native CI\n82\t\n83\tFresh Node22 install/lint/verify/build/full/focused tests and immutable logs.\n84\tRetain initial failures/skips, no hidden retries, no timeout/exclusion weakening.\n85\tPublish native CI only after separate authorization. If blocked leave F004 pending:\n86\tlocal checks do not replace exact final Linux/Windows/macOS/PG16/browser/OCI jobs.\n87\tMain-only provenance and real production recovery remain later gates.\n88\t\n89\t## F005 - Fresh cross-family exact-candidate acceptance\n90\t\n91\tRegistered Kimi, fresh detached candidate; derive independent pre-mutation,\n92\tno-secret/no-mutation probes from actual workflow/scripts, not Generator narrative.\n93\tOriginal verdict/raw evidence immutable. Individual local features may PASS but\n94\tunproved F004 CI and release gates remain WAIT/FAIL. No done without all features.\n95\t\n96\t## Allowed paths and role boundaries\n97\t\n98\t- F001: .github/workflows/deploy-vps.yml, src/cli/service.ts,\n99\t  scripts/ci/assert-macos-launchd-installer.mjs, additive B04 macOS tests and\n100\t  unchanged imported source evidence. Accepted product except service is frozen.\n101\t- F002: same workflow, scripts/deploy-vps-release.sh,\n102\t  scripts/verify-vps-predecessor.sh, additive/imported release-image controls.\n103\t- F003: same workflow, scripts/ci/vps-host-preflight.sh, additive\n104\t  tests/ci/vps-host-preflight*.test.ts, operator preflight docs.\n105\t- F004/F005: new docs/test-reports/BL-RELEASE-READINESS* artifacts/tests,\n106\t  docs/specs, archived state, progress.json/features.json.\n107\t\n108\tCommit each feature as feat(BL-RELEASE-READINESS-Fnnn). Isolated Generator,\n109\tread-only scope critic, registered fresh Kimi Evaluator. Workers never push,\n110\tdeploy, modify Secrets/environments or human decisions. Coordinator transports\n111\texact reviewed diffs, records human authorization and preserves originals.\n112\t\n113\t## Coordinator scope adjudication before implementation\n114\t\n115\tRead-only critic identified old fixture incompatibility with stronger gates.\n116\tOnly two existing test files have narrowly authorized adaptations:\n117\ttests/server/release-rehearsal.test.ts adds verify-macos-agent to its exact\n118\tdeploy needs expectation, retaining every previous prerequisite/assertion.\n119\ttests/server/release-image.test.ts may use bc9badc's fixture additions and new\n120\tcontrols, and its two existing assertion adaptations: immutable digest rejection\n121\tmessage becomes 'immutable candidate manifest differs'; containment ordering\n122\tcompares stop app against the last --env-file (rollback), since preflight now\n123\talso uses --env-file. Retain all old test cases and other behavioral assertions.\n124\tStrengthen the latter with an explicit rollback up-after-stop assertion if needed.\n125\tOriginal bytes are archived in BL-RELEASE-READINESS-inputs-20261008/. No other\n126\told test/evidence changes authorized.\n127\t\n128\tReject 'legacy predecessor' means reject a source-built/non-digest image or a\n129\tmissing activation/config ledger. Old health format without code is acceptable\n130\tONLY with ok=true, exact activated SHA, exact image/config/project/service/port\n131\tevidence; if code exists it must be ready. This permits the separately reviewed\n132\tsame-old-source baseline, not fabricated legacy provenance. Candidate activation\n133\tcontinues to require code=ready. Retain a negative control for wrong health code.\n134\t\n135\tExact imported F001 paths: src/cli/service.ts,\n136\tscripts/ci/assert-macos-launchd-installer.mjs,\n137\ttests/ci/macos-launchd-cleanup-trap.test.ts,\n138\ttests/ci/macos-launchd-installer-gate.test.ts,\n139\ttests/cli/agent-release-installer-macos.test.ts,\n140\ttests/cli/service-launchd.test.ts, tests/server/release-rehearsal.test.ts.\n141\tSource is 3d0a974f4916c911917e1b09811c98d5c96b1ec0 (the final composed B04 bytes);\n142\tworkflow patch must be selective to retain newer B06/B07 gates. F002 source is\n143\tbc9badc8c9c62aaaa2b4aa92ab40d7bc37ee9ed6 for scripts/verify-vps-predecessor.sh,\n144\tscripts/deploy-vps-release.sh and tests/server/release-image.test.ts, with only\n145\tthe declared additive stricter controls. F003 docs path is\n146\tdocs/test-reports/BL-RELEASE-READINESS-generator-20261008/operator-preflight.md.\n147\tProvenance/hash inventory belongs under that same Generator report directory.\n148\t\n149\t### Explicit null health code adjudication\n150\t\n151\tThe imported bc9 predicate uses .code==null, which admits explicit null as well\n152\tas an absent field. The locked wording is intentionally stricter: only a truly\n153\tabsent code field is old-format compatible; if present, code must equal ready.\n154\tApprove exactly this one predicate change in scripts/verify-vps-predecessor.sh:\n155\t((has(\"code\") | not) or .code == \"ready\"), retaining ok=true and exact SHA.\n156\tUse the same rule in F003 inventory. Add explicit-null negative controls in new\n157\ttests; do not alter any existing health assertion. This narrow F002 source-byte\n158\texception supersedes exact bc9 transport for that predicate only; retain source\n159\tand resulting hashes, tagged F002 revision commit and raw failed/rerun evidence."}
